      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استقدر ٱللّٰهَ خَيْرًا</span></b>  <i>He begged God to decree,
appoint, ordain,</i> or <i>decide, for him good.</i> (S, K.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلّٰهُمَّ إِنِّى أَسْتَقْدِرُكَ بِقُدْرَتِكَ</span> <i>O God, I beg Thee
to give me power</i> to do it, <i>by Thy power.</i> (TA,
from a trad.)

